WEBVTT

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.200
Thank you.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:30.680
You

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:04.980
We'll be right back.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.880
I'm alone upon the silence, so I take my life with ease.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:38.840
I'm Robinson Crusoe, and there's only me to please.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:42.760
I have my fun and frolic when I'm playing solid fair.

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:47.080
I'm Robinson Crusoe, all alone and free from care.

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:51.020
I never have appointments, there's no job that I can lose.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:56.040
No better have to nag me when I lay me down loose, loose.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.690
I'm all by myself and glad to be alone.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:04.610
Also, I'm happy all along.

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.120
C-C-Terrible!

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:01.940
Stop it! Stop it!

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.180
No cow's gonna kiss me!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:05.270
Get away from me!

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:32.280
the phone!

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:42.020
Look, a nice cow.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.460
I like you.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:47.120
But this place is only big enough for one of us.

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.180
So get off this island!

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:29.970
I live every day. I'm all by myself and glad to be alive.

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.100
Robinson Crusoe, I'm happy all along.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:10.150
I can't spoil all I do with you.
